  "releaseNotes": "* Fea #138, 添加GetHostNameW\n* Fea #158, 2025秋季兼容性更新\n  - SetWindowsHookExW行为对齐6.0，WH_KEYBOARD_LL/WH_MOUSE_LL且dwThreadId为0时，hMod允许为NULL。\n  - WriteFile、ReadFile行为对齐6.2，允许LPDWORD与LPOVERLAPPED同时为nullptr。",
